*There seem to be a few conflicting details in your case description (a contract dispute in family court, and locations in both Denver and Fulton County, GA). You should clarify this immediately:*
* "Can we review the exact venue and jurisdiction of this case? I want to make sure I understand why a contract dispute is being handled in family court, and how the Denver and Fulton County locations interact in our proceedings."
